load/t_thumb/sc7z3p.jpg"}, {"id": 372082, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc7z3m.jpg"}, {"id": 372086, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc7z3q.jpg"}, {"id": 372087, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc7z3r.jpg"}], "slug": "tales-from-off-peak-city-vol-1", "storyline": "It\u2019s a hazy Sunday morning on the corner of July Avenue and Yam Street. Caetano Grosso, a former saxophone player and longtime pizza-maker, is just getting his pizza oven warmed up. Orders are trickling in, and he needs someone to help with the deliveries. You sense an opportunity, but unbeknownst to him, what you\u2019re really after is his old saxophone, and you\u2019re going to get it one way or another. Your pursuit will set off a chain of events across the neighborhood, taking you deep into the hidden worlds and private lives of the people living there.", "summary": "Tales From Off-Peak City is a first-person adventure game series.\nVolume 1: Caetano's Slice is the first game of many in the anthology of Tales. While each 'Volume' is its own self-contained story and experience, taken together, they build towards the larger over-arching narrative of what\u2019s really going on at the corner of July Avenue and Yam Street and what role you ultimately play in its fate.", "themes": [{"id": 20, "name": "Thriller"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/tales-from-off-peak-city-vol-1", "videos": [{"id": 40981, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "PmuDwtxlSPM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PmuDwtxlSPM", "title": "Humble Bundle Presents: Tales From Off-Peak City Vol. 1", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/PmuDwtxlSPM/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 10580, "name": "Off-Peak"}]}